          "actions": {
            "value": 2
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per hour</p><hr /><p>Your stoicism and courage seem to drive off darkness and shadow. For 1 minute, you suppress magical darkness effects of a rank equal to or lower than half your level rounded up within a @Template[type:emanation|distance:10]. This doesn't provide light, but merely restores the area to its natural illumination level. You can Dismiss this aura.</p>\n<p>If your horse is at least a mature animal companion, you can use Repel Darkness to cause the aura to emanate from your horse instead of you, as long as your horse is within 100 feet.</p>"
          },
